      "en": "• Practical improvements have been made to various parts based on the concept of expanding Grimoire's functionality!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 脚部のシザークロウは展開し、敵に切りかかるど派手なアクションポーズを再現可能！",
      "en": "• The scissor claws on the legs can be expanded to recreate flashy action poses such as cutting at enemies!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 独立機として機能するミニモアが2体付属し、ランドセル内に収納できる！",
      "en": "• Two mini-mores that function as independent machines are included and can be stored inside the school bag!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ライフルは分裂し、個別の武装パーツとしても装備可能！",
      "en": "• The rifle can be split and equipped as individual armed parts!"
